    "body": "Yes. All I’m saying is, adding cross-origin to the CORP doesn’t make sense. When we have same-site value, opposite of that has to be cross-site, not cross-origin. Because the term “cross-origin“ technically includes “same-site” but “cross-origin” resources.",
